{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zEPOGT7WN21794888621.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》劇情緊湊，除了連場明爭暗鬥外，劇中亦不乏浪漫感情線。日前一集便講述陳星妤因遭楊茜堯反對加入娛樂圈而大感失落，獨自走到街頭散心期間，天公不作美突然下起大雨，令她在冷雨中狼狽不堪。此時黃庭鋒及時現身，手持雨傘走到她身旁遮風擋雨，二人隨即展開一段浪漫戲碼。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-17-11h56m29s911.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hvZRsN9ZH61794888550.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>為讓觀眾一睹幕後實況，陳星妤近日於社交平台公開該場雨中戲的拍攝花絮短片，感性重現角色心聲並分享拍攝點滴：「初次見面 ，抱歉讓你看到了這般模樣的我… 記得拍攝那晚天氣開始轉涼，雖然拍完感冒了幾天，但我很享受這個過程。」</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:26.035871+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:57:16.440304+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:42:34.584003+00:00","content_hash":"731d3d611dad8abfdd48a8ccf4e41c7dee8bd9b5130b356c0a896ee088e39351","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:26.035871+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}